# oracle: RHEO 2d oxidizing bar, cut down from examples/rheo/oxidation (a 60 x 40 box with a bar of 16 x 37 fluid and solid particles instead of 120 x 80, t/form 10 instead of 100 so that the shell bonds form within 600 steps, 200 steps instead of 40000, thermo every 100): atom_style hybrid rheo/thermal bond, fix rheo thermal shift surface/detection coordination, fix rheo/viscosity, rheo/pressure and rheo/thermal (react), fix rheo/oxidation creating the oxide bonds, bond_style hybrid bpm/spring rheo/shell, fix add/heat (linear and constant with overwrite), a dynamic group on coordination, pair hybrid/overlay rheo and rheo/solid, wall/harmonic, gravity, setforce and compute nbond/shell
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-3 abs=1e-12
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box), engine vs native: the oxide bonds are made at step 75 and the shell bonds form between steps 150 and 200 (the bond counts agree at every row). Thermo ke and press agree to 1e-15 relative at every row up to step 200. The atoms differ at the surface: the surface normals of the color-gradient sums differ in the last bit (w96rheo_icecubes), and a normal component of 1e-17 changes the branch of the shift velocity in correct_surfaces, so the surface atoms separate: the largest atom error (atom 552) is 3.7e-4 in x at step 100 and 3.2e-3 at step 200; scaled by max(1, |value|) the atom errors are xu 3.4e-5 and 2.9e-4, yu 9.6e-6 and 8.2e-5 at steps 100 and 200, and the velocities and forces agree to 3e-15. The atom tolerance is loosened to 1e-3 so the case guards the behaviour; it is not a 1e-8 parity claim.
units        lj
dimension    2
atom_style   hybrid rheo/thermal bond
boundary     m m p
comm_modify  vel yes
newton       off

region       box block -30 30 0 40 -0.01 0.01 units box
create_box   3 box bond/types 2 extra/bond/per/atom 20 extra/special/per/atom 50

region       lbar block -8 0 3 40 EDGE EDGE units box
region       rbar block 0 8 3 40 EDGE EDGE units box
region       bar union 2 lbar rbar
region       floor block EDGE EDGE EDGE 3.0 EDGE EDGE units box

lattice      hex 1.0
create_atoms 1 region bar
create_atoms 3 region floor

set          region rbar type 2
group        bar type 1 2
group        rbar type 2
group        floor type 3

set          group all sph/e 0.0
set          group all rheo/status 1

variable     cut equal 3.0
variable     n equal 1.0
variable     rho0 equal 1.0
variable     cs equal 1.0
variable     mp equal ${rho0}/${n}
variable     zeta equal 0.05
variable     kappa equal 0.1*${rho0}/${mp}
variable     dt_max equal 0.1*${cut}/${cs}/3
variable     eta equal 0.05
variable     Cv equal 1.0
variable     L equal 0.1
variable     Tf equal 1.0

mass         * ${mp}
timestep     0.1

pair_style   hybrid/overlay rheo ${cut} artificial/visc ${zeta} rheo/solid
pair_coeff   * * rheo
pair_coeff   * * rheo/solid 1.0 1.0 1.0

special_bonds lj 0.0 1.0 1.0 coul 0.0 1.0 1.0
create_bonds many bar bar 1 0 1.5
special_bonds lj 0.0 1.0 1.0 coul 1.0 1.0 1.0

bond_style   hybrid bpm/spring rheo/shell t/form 10
bond_coeff   1 bpm/spring 1.0 1.0 1.0
bond_coeff   2 rheo/shell 0.2 0.2 0.1

compute      coord all rheo/property/atom coordination
variable     surf atom c_coord<22
group        surf dynamic all var surf every 10

fix          1 all rheo ${cut} quintic 0 thermal shift surface/detection coordination 22 8
fix          2 all rheo/viscosity * constant ${eta}
fix          3 all rheo/pressure * linear
fix          4 all rheo/thermal conductivity * constant ${kappa} specific/heat * constant ${Cv} Tfreeze * constant ${Tf} latent/heat * constant ${L} react 1.5 1
fix          5 rbar rheo/oxidation 1.5 2 1.0
fix          6 all wall/harmonic ylo EDGE 2.0 1.0 1.0
fix          7 all gravity 5e-5 vector 0 -1 0
fix          8 floor setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0
fix          9 surf add/heat linear 1.1 0.5
fix          10 floor add/heat constant 0 overwrite yes
fix          11 all enforce2d

compute      surf all rheo/property/atom surface
compute      rho all rheo/property/atom rho
compute      phase all rheo/property/atom phase
compute      temp all rheo/property/atom temperature
compute      eng all rheo/property/atom energy
compute      nbond_shell all rheo/property/atom nbond/shell
compute      nbond_solid all nbond/atom bond/type 1

thermo       100
thermo_style custom step time ke press atoms
thermo_modify format float %.15g
run 200
